---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import SectionHeading from "@/components/SectionHeading.astro";
import { capabilityBoundaries, proofOfPractice as proofSignals, proofStandards } from "@/data/proof";
---

<Base title="Proof of practice | Global Enterprise" description="Confidential, abstract proof of Global Enterprise’s work forming ventures, building products, and operating AI, data, and secure infrastructure systems." image="/media/original/work-field-visit.avif" keywords={["consulting proof of practice", "confidential transformation work", "AI product development", "enterprise operating systems"]}>
  <section class="bg-ink py-20 text-white md:py-28">
    <div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_.72fr] lg:items-end">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow text-lime">Proof of practice</p>
        <h1 class="section-title mt-7 max-w-5xl">The work is confidential. The operating pattern is not.</h1>
        <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-xl leading-relaxed text-white/70">We cannot publish every company, product, or operating detail we have touched. We can show the repeated moves behind the work: forming institutions, shipping systems, making intelligence useful, and leaving a stronger operating rhythm behind.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-l-2 border-lime pl-6">
        <p class="eyebrow text-lime">The boundary</p>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-sm text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75">This page is abstract by design. It describes internal portfolio practice without naming clients or product identifiers, and it does not present internal work as a client endorsement.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-site">
      <SectionHeading eyebrow="What we have built and grown" title="Repeated delivery across the whole system." text={`The evidence basis is the operating history of ventures and products formed, built, and grown through our Delaware-based company. Identifiers remain private; the mechanisms remain inspectable.`} />
      <div class="mt-14 grid gap-px border border-line bg-line md:grid-cols-2">
        {proofSignals.map((signal) => <article class="bg-white p-8 md:min-h-[24rem] md:p-10"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-cobalt">{signal.eyebrow}</p><h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-medium leading-tight tracking-[-0.05em]">{signal.title}</h2><p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">{signal.summary}</p></article>)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad bg-paper">
    <div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-24">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">The mechanism</p><h2 class="section-title mt-5 max-w-3xl">A proof story should let a serious reader see how the work happened.</h2></div>
      <div class="space-y-10">
        {proofSignals.map((signal) => <article class="border-t border-line pt-6"><p class="eyebrow text-cobalt">{signal.eyebrow}</p><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-medium tracking-[-0.05em]">{signal.title}</h3><p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">{signal.detail}</p><ul class="mt-5 grid gap-2 text-sm text-muted sm:grid-cols-3">{signal.signals.map((item) => <li class="border-l-2 border-line pl-3">{item}</li>)}</ul></article>)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-24">
      <div><p class="eyebrow text-cobalt">Capability boundaries</p><h2 class="section-title mt-5 max-w-3xl">Useful range, stated precisely.</h2><p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">These are areas we can help a qualified team examine. The boundary matters: readiness, planning, and delivery support are not substitutes for the client’s evidence, authority, or operating decisions.</p></div>
      <div class="grid gap-px border border-line bg-line md:grid-cols-2">{capabilityBoundaries.map((capability) => <article class="bg-white p-7 md:p-8"><p class="eyebrow text-cobalt">{capability.label}</p><h3 class="mt-8 font-display text-2xl font-medium leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em]">{capability.title}</h3><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{capability.text}</p></article>)}</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad bg-cobalt text-white">
    <div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-24">
      <div><p class="eyebrow text-lime">Our publishing standard</p><h2 class="section-title mt-5 max-w-3xl">Discretion increases the burden of precision.</h2></div>
      <div class="grid gap-px border border-white/20 bg-white/20 md:grid-cols-3">{proofStandards.map((standard) => <div class="bg-cobalt p-7 md:p-8"><p class="font-display text-2xl text-lime">{standard.label}</p><p class="mt-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/70">{standard.text}</p></div>)}</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-site grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.7fr_1.3fr] lg:gap-24">
      <div><p class="eyebrow text-cobalt">Diligence path</p><h2 class="section-title mt-5 max-w-3xl">A serious buyer should be able to go deeper.</h2></div>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted"><p>The public portfolio is abstract because identifiers and permissions are not public. For a qualified conversation, we can establish the appropriate path for a proof pack: the engagement or venture scope, timeframe, operating move, deliverables, evidence available, outcome measures, and confidentiality boundary.</p><p>That path may include a private leadership qualification dossier, permissioned references, a redacted artifact, or an NDA discussion. We will not turn a private relationship into a public logo wall or imply a client endorsement where none exists.</p><a class="btn-dark" href="/contact/">Request a diligence engagement <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-lime"><div class="container-site flex flex-col gap-8 py-16 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between"><h2 class="max-w-2xl font-display text-4xl font-medium tracking-[-0.05em] md:text-5xl">Bring us the version of the problem that cannot be published yet.</h2><a class="btn-dark shrink-0" href="/contact/">Request a private diligence engagement <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</Base>
